+# The script is deterministic and the agent is not, so the two are
+# kept apart. Before the pass this script fetches, rebases your work
+# and the mail outbox, and picks the oldest inbox message. It then runs
+# a fresh claude with the prompt shipped beside it and that message's
+# id. The agent's output goes to /dev/null; whether the pass worked is
